WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.060 --> 00:00:02.130
- All right, we've got
one last feel-good story

00:00:02.130 --> 00:00:03.180
to close out this hour.

00:00:03.180 --> 00:00:04.497
This is What I'm Liking.

00:00:04.497 --> 00:00:06.610
(dramatic drum beats)

00:00:06.610 --> 00:00:07.610
(audience cheering)

00:00:07.610 --> 00:00:12.070
An Idaho mama has launched an
HGTV style series on TikTok,

00:00:12.070 --> 00:00:14.650
but this one seems just
a little more achievable

00:00:14.650 --> 00:00:15.700
to lots of people out there,

00:00:15.700 --> 00:00:18.370
given that it's gotten more
than 3.6 million views.

00:00:18.370 --> 00:00:19.230
Take a look.

00:00:19.230 --> 00:00:21.430
- Entry space is the first impression.

00:00:21.430 --> 00:00:22.640
Choose design elements

00:00:22.640 --> 00:00:24.520
that say welcome to my beautiful home.

00:00:24.520 --> 00:00:26.210
Immediately when you walk in,

00:00:26.210 --> 00:00:28.530
the layout says casual elegance.

00:00:28.530 --> 00:00:29.840
Nothings says, welcome in,

00:00:29.840 --> 00:00:33.210
like some items of interest
displayed on your area rug.

00:00:33.210 --> 00:00:34.790
Like a dog collar,

00:00:34.790 --> 00:00:36.970
some fruit snacks, some tape,

00:00:36.970 --> 00:00:40.010
and the dog hair kind
of ties it all together.

00:00:40.010 --> 00:00:41.910
We have an open area
underneath our stairs.

00:00:41.910 --> 00:00:44.560
I like to call this my
farmhouse chic area.

00:00:44.560 --> 00:00:46.570
Choose our great design element

00:00:46.570 --> 00:00:48.400
and don't be afraid to mix them up.

00:00:48.400 --> 00:00:50.220
We have an UGG up here,

00:00:50.220 --> 00:00:52.020
boots, tennis shoes,

00:00:52.020 --> 00:00:53.750
and just one flip flop,

00:00:53.750 --> 00:00:56.750
and balance it all out with
a hoodie throw on the ground,

00:00:56.750 --> 00:00:59.090
and a hair tie up on the bench.

00:00:59.090 --> 00:01:00.370
- All right, so we have the woman

00:01:00.370 --> 00:01:03.630
behind the decor by Jody
TikToks, on the line right now,

00:01:03.630 --> 00:01:06.260
watching on KXLY TV at 4:00 PM.

00:01:06.260 --> 00:01:07.889
What's up Jody?

00:01:07.889 --> 00:01:08.820
(audience cheering)

00:01:08.820 --> 00:01:09.813
- Hi Kelly.

00:01:10.800 --> 00:01:12.380
- Girl, you...

00:01:12.380 --> 00:01:14.530
I like almost had all
my makeup redone again.

00:01:14.530 --> 00:01:15.700
That video is so funny.

00:01:15.700 --> 00:01:18.600
What inspired these videos and
what inspired you to do it?

00:01:19.830 --> 00:01:21.360
- Well, we love our house,

00:01:21.360 --> 00:01:22.790
but it's always messy,

00:01:22.790 --> 00:01:25.270
and it seems like no
matter how hard I try,

00:01:25.270 --> 00:01:26.810
I can't get it organized.

00:01:26.810 --> 00:01:27.643
And I thought,

00:01:27.643 --> 00:01:30.005
well maybe there's
something funny about that.

00:01:30.005 --> 00:01:33.230
Because, like when I look at
a table and I'll see a hammer,

00:01:33.230 --> 00:01:35.574
or an empty bag of chips, dental floss.

00:01:35.574 --> 00:01:36.407
(Kelly laughs)

00:01:36.407 --> 00:01:37.880
I'm like why?

00:01:37.880 --> 00:01:41.260
I mean, technically we are empty nesters,

00:01:41.260 --> 00:01:43.810
but there always seems to
be people coming and going

00:01:43.810 --> 00:01:44.643
from our house.

00:01:44.643 --> 00:01:47.320
Like our grown kids will
stop by, or their friends.

00:01:47.320 --> 00:01:49.110
We babysit our nieces sometimes.

00:01:49.110 --> 00:01:52.180
And I'm technically
kinda still on mom duty,

00:01:52.180 --> 00:01:54.260
which I'm so grateful for.

00:01:54.260 --> 00:01:55.640
But then I'll look around and I'll say.

00:01:55.640 --> 00:01:56.473
- But pick up your crap.

00:01:56.473 --> 00:01:58.215
- Somebody better pickup all the shoes.

00:01:58.215 --> 00:01:59.048
(Kelly laughing)

00:01:59.048 --> 00:02:01.250
- I'm really grateful for
it, but pick up your stuff.

00:02:02.350 --> 00:02:04.470
- Then I realize they're all my shoes.

00:02:04.470 --> 00:02:05.660
- Oh my God, I love that you're like,

00:02:05.660 --> 00:02:07.100
it's really interesting to mix it up,

00:02:07.100 --> 00:02:08.096
mix the shoes up.

00:02:08.096 --> 00:02:09.080
(laughs)

00:02:09.080 --> 00:02:10.980
So when you say that
you have a lot of people

00:02:10.980 --> 00:02:11.813
who can relate,

00:02:11.813 --> 00:02:13.060
I am one of them, by the way,

00:02:13.060 --> 00:02:15.760
like this must have resonated
with so many people out there.

00:02:15.760 --> 00:02:17.410
- Yeah, that's been really fun.

00:02:17.410 --> 00:02:19.187
Like a lot of the comments are,

00:02:19.187 --> 00:02:20.690
"How did you get into my house?"

00:02:20.690 --> 00:02:24.170
Or, "Do you have a hidden
camera in my kitchen?"

00:02:24.170 --> 00:02:27.950
And I think a lot of people
are on the decor by Jody trend,

00:02:27.950 --> 00:02:29.680
and they don't even know it.

00:02:29.680 --> 00:02:31.148
And Kelly, I have to tell you,

00:02:31.148 --> 00:02:32.093
(Kelly laughs)

00:02:32.093 --> 00:02:34.100
I have to tell you, Kelly,
my favorite song of yours

00:02:34.100 --> 00:02:36.360
has always been "Beautiful Disaster".

00:02:36.360 --> 00:02:37.193
- [Kelly] Oh my God.

00:02:37.193 --> 00:02:40.470
- And so now I guess that's my theme song.

00:02:40.470 --> 00:02:42.660
- You are so funny, Jody.

00:02:42.660 --> 00:02:44.040
I love you so much for this.

00:02:44.040 --> 00:02:46.250
It's so funny, everybody
out there relates to this.

00:02:46.250 --> 00:02:49.360
And we're all trying to keep
it clean, but somehow, yep,

00:02:49.360 --> 00:02:50.950
just crap ends up everywhere.

00:02:50.950 --> 00:02:53.150
And that's everyone's house with kids.

00:02:53.150 --> 00:02:54.070
Thank you so much Jody.

00:02:54.070 --> 00:02:55.496
I'm liking your posts right now, right?

00:02:55.496 --> 00:02:56.400
- [Jody] Thank you.

00:02:56.400 --> 00:02:58.090
(audience cheers)

00:02:58.090 --> 00:02:59.600
- And that's not all,

00:02:59.600 --> 00:03:02.930
our season long partner,
Pilot, pen makers of Frixion,

00:03:02.930 --> 00:03:04.930
the go to erasable pen of
The Kelly Clarkson Show

00:03:04.930 --> 00:03:07.050
want to celebrate those
creating fearlessly,

00:03:07.050 --> 00:03:08.550
just like you ma'am.

00:03:08.550 --> 00:03:11.459
So they're gonna give you
$1,000 to help you out.

00:03:11.459 --> 00:03:13.236
(audience cheers)

00:03:13.236 --> 00:03:15.147
- Thank you so much.

00:03:15.147 --> 00:03:18.610
- You can at least pay someone
to come in and clean it up

00:03:18.610 --> 00:03:20.150
so you don't have to do that.

